<view class="page"><view class="profile-head"><view class="avatar">先</view><view><text class="title">我的惜食记录</text><text class="sub">与令令一起，把每一份好好吃完</text></view></view>
<view class="weekly card" data-url="/pages/weekly-report/weekly-report" bindtap="go"><view class="weekly-top"><text>本周概览</text><text class="link">查看报告 ›</text></view><view class="stat-grid"><view><text class="stat-number">{{report.ingredientsAdded}}</text><text>新增食材</text></view><view><text class="stat-number">{{report.ingredientsConsumed}}</text><text>完成使用</text></view><view><text class="stat-number">{{report.priorityCompleted}}</text><text>优先完成</text></view></view></view>
<view class="growth card"><view><text class="menu-title">令令成长</text><text class="sub">Lv.{{lingling.level}} {{lingling.stageName}}</text></view><view class="growth-num">{{lingling.xp}} XP</view></view>
<view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">偏好与设置</text></view><view class="settings card"><view><view><text class="menu-title">每日提醒</text><text class="sub">按建议日期提醒优先食材</text></view><switch checked="{{reminders}}" color="#789176" bindchange="toggle" /></view><view bindtap="about"><text class="menu-title">产品说明</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view></view>
<view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">数据</text></view><view class="settings card"><view class="danger" bindtap="reset"><view><text class="menu-title">重置本地数据</text><text class="sub">清空食材、成长与兑换记录</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view></view>
<text class="footer">FIRST BITE · 珍惜食物，从先吃开始</text></view>
